BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Match Day Watch Parties
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260719T140000
UID:match-day-watch-parties-2026-07-19t14-00-00-04-00@agakhanmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/06
 /soccer-ball-museum-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.png?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Gather with fellow fans to celebrate every goal\, save\, and u
 nforgettable moment at the final Match Day Watch Party in the Nanji Family
  Foundation Auditorium.\n\nReserve a ticket to guarantee your spot. Walk-i
 n guests are welcome and may attend without a ticket\, subject to availabl
 e capacity.\n\nBefore kickoff\, enjoy games\, inflatables\, and family-fri
 endly festivities in the Aga Khan Park during Soccerfest starting at 11 am
 .
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/match-day-watch-parties/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
